The road events come from the open data of the French national road network
(réseau routier national non concédé), produced by the interdepartmental road
directorates (DIR) and published by Bison Futé on tipi.bison-fute.gouv.fr and
transport.data.gouv.fr under the Licence Ouverte / Open Licence 2.0 (Etalab).
The traffic forecasts are read from the calendar published on
www.bison-fute.gouv.fr. Each event shows the DIR it comes from and the update
time of the feed. Communes are found with geo.api.gouv.fr, an open API of the
French government.

This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
Bison Futé, the French Ministry in charge of transport or the DIR.
